      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Because you need line of site of the person, or at least some person so you can use the left/right arrows, there is no way to open the submenu to show or hide their avatar if you are not able to click at least someone. This is especially difficult for desktop mode as the menu, which needs to be active to even click on someone, can't be moved out of the way and covers 80% of the center area of the screen.",
