  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-09-27T05:37:30.005Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Often there are problems selecting players in-game and to see more info on their avatars, if you want to mute them, or show their avatars. It would be a good idea to instead of selecting their avatar physically, have the ability to access the same player option menu by selecting their profile in the social menu's list or the list that shows all the players in a world.",
